OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of boy with rare condition
OL,4,A'give back'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a boy born with a rare
OL,7,Fcondition say a hospital charity's
OL,8,Fintervention meant they did not have to
OL,9,Fspend months in a hotel while their son
OL,10,Fwas critically ill.
OL,12,FThree-year-old Max, from Axminster in
OL,13,FDevon, was transferred from hospital in
OL,14,FExeter to the intensive neonatal unit
OL,15,Fat St Michael's Hospital in Bristol,
OL,16,Fand spent more than four months between
OL,17,Fthe unit and nearby Bristol Royal
OL,18,FHospital for Children.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
